        "id": 1659539
      },
      "writtenOn": "2024-11-19T12:40:49Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Fair enough, I just checked and the `AudioManagerInternal` is registered in the `AudioManager` service creation, so it won\u0027t be available either.\n\nCould you please update the `mRingerMode` initialization to use `AudioManager.RINGER_MODE_NORMAL` by default, so the missing service won\u0027t affect vibrations?\n\nI think you need to update `updateRingerMode` to be a bit less strict as well, otherwise all notification/ringtone vibrations will always be disabled.\n\nCould you please also update `VibrationSettings` to cover these scenarios? Thanks!",
      "parentUuid": "a42cdcb5_771bf8de",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 239,
        "startChar": 54,
        "endLine": 239,
        "endChar": 56
      },
